  "bodyHash": "LyEgQwmiU7Q=",
  "content": "<p><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/734514387498565673/1187234714629718086/MD.png?ex=6596257d&amp;is=6583b07d&amp;hm=8c825798024375c99e5087a96202cfe8e7b0fe27fc604c51bab765163504f3e9&amp;\" alt=\"\" width=\"508\" height=\"120\">&nbsp;<br></span></p><p><strong><strong>📖 </strong><strong>關於</strong><strong>：</strong></strong><strong><br></strong><strong><strong>礦工樂趣</strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">是</span><strong><span style=\"color:#930\"> <a style=\"color:#930\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">農夫樂</span></a></span></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">的一個擴充，新增了</span><strong>以洞穴為核心</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">的烹飪內容，包含一種新的、</span><strong>神秘的<span style=\"font-weight:400\">肉味</span>作物</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">，生長在洞穴中！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">嘗試新穎獨特的食材，準備美味或不凡的佳餚，與你的朋友們分享！！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">這個農夫樂的擴充模組專注於讓</span><strong>美食內容在挖礦時更易取得</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">！！！</span><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><br></span><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><br></span><strong><strong>📦 測試版</strong></strong><strong><br><br></strong></p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">此模組目前</span><strong>仍在開發中</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">，可能會出現問題或不穩定情況。如果你想遊玩，請注意：</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><strong><strong>經常備份你的存檔</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">；</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">在加入模組包前，請確認一切運作正常；</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">若發現任何問題，請回報至我們的</span><span style=\"color:#008080\"><a style=\"color:#008080\" href=\"https://github.com/SammySemicolon/MinersDelight/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><strong>GitHub！！</strong></span></a></span><span style=\"font-weight:400\">這對我們很有幫助！</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"color:#930\"><strong>如果你想支持我，可以到我的</strong> <a style=\"color:#930\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmrstdraw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>KO-FI</strong></a><strong>捐贈 :D</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"color:#930\"><strong>如果你想支持程式設計師，請訪問他們的</strong> <a style=\"color:#930\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/sammysemicolon\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Patreon</strong></a><strong>！！！</strong></span><strong><br></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul><p><strong><strong>🎂 </strong><strong>特色</strong> <strong>(1.20+)</strong><strong>：</strong></strong><strong><br></strong><strong><br></strong><strong><strong>◉&nbsp; 銅鍋：</strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">這種新的烹飪用具</span><strong><strong>比傳統鍋略小</strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">，專門用於</span><strong>快速餐點。</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><br></span><strong>燉菜和湯品</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">用此鍋烹調後應</span><strong>裝在銅杯中享用...</strong><strong><br></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">（這些杯子可以盛裝半份量，但食用速度加倍，非常適合分享或快速用餐）</span><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><br></span><strong>◉&nbsp; <strong>銅杯：</strong> </strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">類似於桶，但</span><strong><strong>不能裝岩漿</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">。</span></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><br><br></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">🍄 </span><strong>新食材：</strong><strong><br></strong><strong><br></strong><strong>◉&nbsp; 洞穴胡蘿蔔：</strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">新</span><strong><strong>作物</strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">，可在洞穴中的野生環境找到——如果你想尋找</span><strong><strong>肉的味道</strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">，這是素食替代品。別猶豫，採集它並在你的花園中</span><strong>重新種植吧！！！</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><br></span><strong><strong>◉&nbsp; 棉絮花：</strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">新</span><strong><strong>花朵</strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">，生長在野生洞穴胡蘿蔔上，你</span><strong>可以用它來<span style=\"font-weight:400\">製作線</span>。</strong><strong><br></strong><strong><strong>◉&nbsp; 蝙蝠：</strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">新</span><strong><strong>小吃</strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">，在洞穴中容易取得... 手持</span><strong>小刀</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">加上一點運氣就能獲得！適合用來準備</span><strong><strong>速食</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">～</span></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><br></span><strong><strong>◉&nbsp; 蠹魚卵：</strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">沒有</span><strong>合適的工具</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">很難取得，但它們可以用於</span><strong><strong>散播瘟疫</strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">，許多人喜歡在</span><strong><strong>精緻菜餚</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">中品嚐它們。</span></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><br></span><strong><strong>◉&nbsp; 節肢動物</strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><strong>：</strong>新</span><strong><strong>蟲肉</strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">，如果你真的需要蛋白質且有一把小刀，這在洞穴中是最佳選擇！！別被它的外表騙了，它是</span><strong><strong>美食家的最愛</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">...</span></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><br></span><strong><strong>◉&nbsp; 魷魚：</strong> </strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">新</span><strong><strong>釣魚</strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">，如果你有幸擁有釣竿或在水中發現它們遊蕩，就可以大快朵頤！！務必用</span><strong><strong>小刀</strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">處理，以免過度損傷肉質...</span><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><br><br></span></p><p><strong><strong>📦 </strong><strong>新方塊</strong><strong>：</strong></strong><strong><br></strong><strong><br></strong><strong><strong>◉&nbsp; 黏性籃子：</strong>功能與農夫樂的籃子相同，</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">但裡面的物品</strong><strong>只能透過漏斗取出</strong></span><span style=\"font-weight:400\">，而與其</span><strong><strong>接觸的實體只能跳半格高。</strong></strong><strong><br></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">可用作捐贈籃（無法被掠奪 &gt;:D！！）或簡單的實體陷阱</span><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><br></span><span style=\"font-weight:400\">（當進水時，會失去黏性，使被困在內的實體得以逃脫）</span><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;</span></p><hr><p><strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">⚠️</span><strong> 特色（1.19）：</strong></strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;</span><strong>特色：</strong></p>\n<p><strong><strong>◉&nbsp; 銅鍋：</strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">這種新的烹飪用具比傳統鍋略小</span><strong>（不能製作盛宴）</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">，但烹調速度稍</span><strong>快。</strong><strong><br></strong><strong>湯品和燉菜</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">用此鍋烹調後只能裝在</span><strong>銅杯</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">中，以保持其「風味」（所有裝在杯中的食物都會賦予加速效果）。</span><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><br></span><strong><strong>◉&nbsp; 銅杯：</strong> </strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">類似於桶，但</span><strong>不能裝岩漿</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><br></span><strong><strong>◉&nbsp; 野生洞穴胡蘿蔔：</strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">一種在洞穴中野生發現的</span><strong>作物</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">，採集後可獲得棉絮花，運氣好還能得到一些洞穴胡蘿蔔（成為第一個種植它的人！！）</span><strong><br></strong><strong><strong>◉&nbsp; 棉絮花：</strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">一種</span><strong>花朵</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">，可用來製作</span><strong>線</strong><strong><br></strong><strong><br></strong><strong><strong>◉ 新掉落物：</strong></strong><strong><br></strong><strong><strong> -蝙蝠：</strong></strong> <strong>0-1 個翅膀</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">，如果用</span><strong>小刀</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">殺死，必定</span><strong>掉落 2 個翅膀</strong><strong><br></strong><strong><strong>-魷魚：</strong> </strong><strong>0-3 條觸手</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">，如果用</span><strong>小刀</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">殺死，必定</span><strong>掉落 1 個魷魚（螢光魷魚會掉落對應物品）</strong><strong><br></strong><strong><strong>-釣魚：</strong></strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">現在玩家可以釣到</span><strong>魷魚</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">和</span><strong>螢光魷魚</strong><strong><br></strong><strong><br></strong><strong><strong>◉&nbsp; 黏性籃子：</strong> </strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">功能與農夫樂的</span><strong>籃子相同，但裡面的物品只能透過漏斗取出</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">，而與其</span><strong>接觸的實體只能跳半格高。</strong><strong>可用作捐贈籃（無法被掠奪 &gt;:D！！）或簡單的實體陷阱。</strong><strong><br></strong><strong><strong>◉&nbsp; 蠹魚卵：</strong>稀有掉落物</strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">，來自破壞受感染的方塊，</span> <span style=\"font-weight:400\">也可以通過殺死蠹魚獲得，但機率更低，還可用來感染方塊。</span></p>\n</div><hr><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><br></span><strong><strong>📝 常見問題：</strong></strong></p><ul>\n<li><strong><strong>我可以將此模組加入我的模組包嗎？</strong></strong><strong><br></strong><strong>&nbsp; </strong><span style=\"font-weight:400\">可以！你可以將此模組加入你的模組包，但請使用 Curse/CurseForge 下載，請勿重新託管檔案。</span><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><br></span><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><br></span></li>\n<li><strong><strong>這個模組最終會移植到 Fabric 或其他載入器嗎？</strong></strong></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp;&nbsp;不會，很遺憾不行。除非有人願意移植，否則此模組僅會在 Forge 上維護。（請先與我們聯繫）</span><span style=\"font-weight:400\"><br><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kZHTdarZvN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>香蕉麵包愛好者俱樂部</strong> <strong>Discord</strong></a> <span style=\"font-weight:400\">歡迎提問或閒聊～</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
